; Multi-currency beancount: open accounts for BTC and USD, post a
; transaction with cost-basis annotation. Our shim parses the cost basis
; `{50000 USD}` but doesn't model lot tracking — the balances still come
; out right because the amount + commodity are extracted correctly.

2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash USD
2024-01-01 open Assets:Crypto:BTC BTC

2024-01-15 * "Bought BTC"
  Assets:Crypto:BTC                    1.00 BTC {50000 USD}
  Assets:Cash                     -50000.00 USD
